{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39833","headline":"送道者朝见後归山 · 殷文圭","name":"送道者朝见後归山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂随蒲帛谒金銮，萧洒风仪傲汉官。\n天马难将朱索绊，海鳌宁觉碧涛宽。\n松坛月作尊前伴，竹箧书爲教外欢。\n神鼎已乾龙虎伏，一条真气出云端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}